   "en": "⟦0⟧ - The shortcut to add for this checkbox.",
   "frags": 1
  },
  {
   "k": "1qgpp7v",
   "en": "⟦0⟧ - Set the hint key the checkbox uses to display a hint tooltip with when hovered over.",
   "frags": 1
  },
  {
   "k": "1n034su",
   "en": "⟦0⟧ - Set the short tooltip this checkbox uses.",
